src-tauri/gen/

# Local environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.direnv/
.xwin-cache/
private/
data/

# Retrospectives are local working artifacts for the maintainer to review, not
# canonical public docs. Durable outcomes get harvested into AGENTS.md/ADRs/docs.
# The canonical retro template is the one tracked exception (ADR 0081): it carries
# the escape taxonomy + per-retro record shape; individual retros stay local.
docs/retros/*
!docs/retros/TEMPLATE.md

